# ScribeCheck API keys. Copy to .env and paste your keys after the "=".
#   cp env.example .env
# .env is gitignored from the first commit. Never commit real keys.
#
# Named env.example rather than .env.example because a local pre-write hook
# blocks any filename matching .env* to stop secrets being written by mistake.
# See docs/DECISIONS.md D005.
#
# All four are free. Use the same account at all four so the
# keys stay together. Projected spend for the 400-clip run: USD 0.00.

# https://console.groq.com/keys
# Sign in with Google, then "Create API Key". No credit card.
# Serves Whisper large-v3 free: 2,000 requests a day, 7,200 audio seconds an
# hour. This run needs 400 requests and 4,290 audio seconds, so it fits inside
# one hour. Replaces the paid OpenAI slot; see docs/DECISIONS.md D016.
GROQ_API_KEY=

# https://console.deepgram.com/signup
# USD 200 free credit on signup, no card. One key covers both the nova-3
# general and nova-3-medical configurations. This run uses USD 1.10 of it.
DEEPGRAM_API_KEY=

# https://www.assemblyai.com/dashboard/signup
# USD 50 free credit on signup, no card. This run uses USD 0.25 of it.
ASSEMBLYAI_API_KEY=

# https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# Sign in with Google, then "Create API key". Free tier; per-account rate
# limits are shown in AI Studio rather than published. Expect some 429s on a
# 400-clip run, which the client backs off and retries automatically.
GOOGLE_API_KEY=
